Flappy Bird Clone

Project Description

Flappy Bird Clone is a simple bird game developed using Python and Pygame. The player controls a bird and tries to pass through pipes without hitting them.

Technologies Used

- Python 3
- Pygame

Features

- Bird movement using gravity
- Jumping with the SPACE key
- Moving pipes
- Score tracking
- Collision detection
- Game Over screen
- Restart functionality

Installation

Install Pygame using the following command:

pip install pygame

How to Run

Run the following command in the terminal:

python flappy_bird.py

Controls

- SPACE: Make the bird jump
- SPACE after Game Over: Restart the game
- ESC: Exit the game

